#quote(block: true)[
This article records several of my favorite Chrome extensions.
]

= PrintFriendly#html.sup(class: "fnref", id: "fnref-1", link("#fn-1")[1])
Make web pages printer-friendly and convert them to PDFs. Easily remove ads and navigation, and customize what you print or PDF.

Convert web pages to PDF, and ignore some non-essential elements, suitable for processing technical blogs and similar content before putting them into Zotero.

#img("/assets/images/chrome-plugin-1.png", alt: "PrintFriendly")
= Wikiwand#html.sup(class: "fnref", id: "fnref-2", link("#fn-2")[2])
AI-driven wiki aggregator created to enhance user experience on Wikipedia by streamlining knowledge consumption.

As featured on TechCrunch, Lifehacker, Gizmodo, Fast Company and The Next Web:

Wikiwand is an award-winning interface that optimizes Wikipedia\'s amazing content for a quicker and significantly improved reading experience!

这才是现代化的 Wiki 界面!!!

- Wikipedia

#img("/assets/images/wikipedia.png", alt: "wikipedia")
- Wikiwand

#img("/assets/images/wikiwand.png", alt: "wikiwand")
= Modern for Hacker News#html.sup(class: "fnref", id: "fnref-3", link("#fn-3")[3])
A redesigned web interface for Hacker News.

Enhance your Hacker News experience with a beautiful, clean, modern design that\'s fully customizable.

Once installed, this extension will simply apply the new look and features to existing Hacker News pages, without you having to do anything.

#quote(block: true)[
Hacker News 的原始界面很难看, 没有阅读的欲望
]

- Old

#img("/assets/images/hn-old.png", alt: "hn-old")
- New

#img("/assets/images/hn-new.png", alt: "hn-new")
= Bionic Reading - AaRead#html.sup(class: "fnref", id: "fnref-4", link("#fn-4")[4])
Read webpages with less effort and increased concentration, use the Bionic Reading method

AaRead is a reading helper for your eyes and brain. It makes some letters extra bold to make reading fast and keep effort low. This is a free alternative to Bionic Reading and Open Dyslexic font, and is great for folks with ADHD, dyslexia, or anyone whose brain gets bored easily when reading.

#quote(block: true)[
阅读长篇大论的纯英文文本时有帮助
]

- Bionic Off

#img("/assets/images/bionic-off.png", alt: "bionic-off")
- Bionic On

#img("/assets/images/bionic-on.png", alt: "bionic-on")
= Gemini Exporter#html.sup(class: "fnref", id: "fnref-5", link("#fn-5")[5])
Export Gemini conversations as PDF, Markdown, text, CSV, and other formats. Free and fully customizable.

#img("/assets/images/gemini-exporter.png", alt: "gemini-exporter")
